    "proseDraft": "Ruth, Pavel and Ines confirmed that on Monday 2026-11-09 the flag goes on for the six design-partner customer accounts and for the CS team at the same time. Other comments about shipping, the flag, the what's-new note, and usage tracking were stated, and no unresolved items were listed.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- Ruth, Pavel and Ines confirmed that on Monday 2026-11-09 the flag goes on for the six design-partner customer accounts and for the CS team at the same time, with recheck passed.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Someone suggested shipping it to the pilot group on Monday.\n- Someone said Monday works.\n- Someone said they would flip the flag first thing.\n- Someone said they would write the what's-new note that shows up when they open reporting.\n- Someone said the note would be three bullets and a link.\n- Someone said sure.\n- Someone asked if usage tracking is wanted on each chart.\n- Someone said yes, chart opens and exports.\n- Someone said they would add the events before Monday.\n- Someone said they would want those numbers in two weeks."
